---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/astro/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/astro/Footer.astro";
// Payment destination for the $500 renewal audit, sent directly by the founder after a
// qualified discovery call (per marketing/gtm/pipeline-build/25-renewal-audit-funnel-launch-package.md:
// "payment is taken manually on the discovery call" until an on-site checkout exists).
// Not a public funnel step, noindexed, nothing links here publicly, only a direct link
// sent post-call. Wraps the Wise payment link (wise.com/pay/r/w3zCdIbg5WRoPAg) with the
// scope/risk-reversal framing so the payer isn't clicking out to a bare payment form with
// no context.
const WISE_PAY_LINK = "https://wise.com/pay/r/w3zCdIbg5WRoPAg";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Pay for Your Renewal Audit | SWOTBee"
  description="Complete payment for your $500 renewal audit, credited in full toward any build."
  robots="noindex, follow"
>
  <Navbar />

  <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-v6-bg to-white px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-16 sm:pt-20 pb-8">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">
      <span class="bg-v6-teal-50 text-v6-teal text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full inline-block mb-6">Renewal Audit</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-v6-dark mb-4">Complete Your Audit Payment</h1>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-v6-text-muted max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Following up from your call. Here's the $500 for the renewal audit we discussed, credited in full toward any build if you move forward.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-md mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pb-6">
    <div class="bg-white border border-v6-border rounded-2xl p-8 text-center shadow-sm">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-v6-text-muted uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Amount due</p>
      <p class="text-4xl font-bold text-v6-dark mb-6">$500 USD</p>
      <a
        href={WISE_PAY_LINK}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        data-ga-cta="pay_audit_wise_link"
        class="block bg-v6-copper text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl text-base font-semibold hover:bg-v6-copper-600 transition-colors"
      >
        Pay with Wise &rarr;
      </a>
      <p class="text-xs text-v6-text-muted mt-4">Opens Wise in a new tab. Bank transfer or card, whichever you have set up.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pb-6">
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <div class="bg-v6-bg rounded-xl p-4">
        <div class="font-bold text-v6-teal text-sm mb-1">What this covers</div>
        <div class="text-sm text-v6-text-muted">A scored renewal-operations diagnostic on your actual HubSpot data: named at-risk deals, unbilled uplifts, and a roadmap. Delivered 3 to 5 business days after we have access.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-v6-bg rounded-xl p-4">
        <div class="font-bold text-v6-teal text-sm mb-1">Credited to your build</div>
        <div class="text-sm text-v6-text-muted">If you move forward with a build afterward, the full $500 comes off the top. If not, you keep the findings either way.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pb-16">
    <p class="text-center text-sm text-v6-text-muted bg-white border border-v6-border rounded-xl p-4">
      View-only access. Nothing leaves your portal. NDA available on request. Access revoked at audit end.
    </p>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
